lk River (Randolph, Webster)\nPendleton Lake\nPipestem Lake\nR. D. Bailey Tailwaters\nTygart Lake Tailwaters\nWheeling Creek\nWilliams River\n10/20/2026\nCranberry River\nNew Creek Dam No. 14\nNorth Fork South Branch\nPinnacle Creek\nPond Fork\nShavers Fork (Bemis)\nShavers Fork (lower section)\nSummit Lake\nUpper Guyandotte River\n10/19/2026\nCacapon Park Lakes\nEvitts Run\nOpequon Creek\nSouth Branch (Franklin)\nSouth Branch (Smoke Hole)\nSummersville Tailwaters\nSutton Tailwaters\n7/1/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nCamp Pioneer Pond\nElk 2 Mile Ponds\nFrench Creek Pond\nKrodel Lake\nRockhouse Lake\nWallback Lake\nThis concludes the catfish stocking for 2026\n6/30/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nMoncove Lake\nFayette County Park Lake\nRaleigh County Airport Pond\n6/26/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nCedar Creek State Park Pond\nConaway Run Lake\nMountwood Park Lake\nNorth Bend State Park Pond\nRollins Lake\n6/25/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nCoopers Rock Lake\nCurtisville Lake\n6/24/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nEdwards Run Ponds\nFort Ashby Lake\nHandley Pond\nHorse Creek Lake\nPendleton Lake\nKrodel Lake\nRaleigh County Airport Pond\nSeneca Lake\nSleepy Creek Lake\nTeter Creek Lake\nTuckahoe Lake\nWatoga Lake\n6/23/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nAnawalt Lake\nBerwind Lake\nBig Ditch Lake\nBrandywine Lake\nBrushy Fork Lake\nCacapon Park Lake\nChief Logan State Park Pond\nDunkard Fork Lake\nFairfax Pond\nFrench Creek Pond\nIndian Rocks Lake\nJames P Bailey Lake\nJimmy Lewis Lake\nKimsey Run Lake\nLaurel Lake\nLogan County Airport Pond\nMason Lake\nParker Hollow Lake\nPoorhouse Lake\nSouth Mill Creek Lake\nTomlinson Run Lake\nWallback Lake\nWarden Lake\n6/22/2026\nCATFISH STOCKINGS\nBarboursville Lake\nBoley Lake\nCoonskin Park Lake\nDeegan Lake\nFayette County Park Lake\nFitzpatrick Lake\nHinkle Lake\nHurricane Reservoir\nLick Creek Pond\nLittle Beaver Lake\nMillers Fork Pond\nPipestem Lake\nTrout Stocking Map\nStocking History and Practices\n304-558-6200\nOffice Hours:\nMon-Fri 8:30am-5:00pm\nAbout